{"id":"Q01","question":"What approval is needed for a $40,000 purchase?","response":{"answer":"For a $40,000 purchase, approval is needed from the division director.","sources":[{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.33965291065290615},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.3737612778345316},{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.5105168591679387}]}}
{"id":"Q02","question":"When are three written quotes required for a purchase?","response":{"answer":"According to the policy, any purchase over $25,000 requires at least three written quotes from independent vendors.","sources":[{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.3647937837745582},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.4161158332352419},{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.4738524021005933}]}}
{"id":"Q03","question":"If an emergency purchase is made before a purchase order exists, how long does the requester have to document it?","response":{"answer":"According to the policy, if an emergency purchase is made before a purchase order exists, the requester must document the emergency and obtain the required approvals within 1 business day.","sources":[{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.31140542749243505},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.3310874841083642},{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.44142202318490864}]}}
{"id":"Q04","question":"Does a $2,000 software subscription need any review besides manager approval?","response":{"answer":"Yes, a $2,000 software subscription requires a cybersecurity review by IT Security before the purchase order can be issued, in addition to manager approval.","sources":[{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.39036913864696554},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.45406940630029635},{"documentName":"it-equipment-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"5a67bef4-7e42-4660-9250-f1a4405d48d1","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.301159Z","chunkId":"8f06696b-71e4-4400-9114-82046e445069","distance":0.47262083884285255}]}}
{"id":"Q05","question":"How much can an invoice differ from the purchase order and still be paid?","response":{"answer":"An invoice can differ from the purchase order by at most 5 percent or $500, whichever is lower. Larger differences require the requester to submit a purchase order change, which needs the same approval level as the original order.","sources":[{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.26499299550053024},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.436298510243075},{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.5155152871442632}]}}
{"id":"Q06","question":"How long are procurement records kept?","response":{"answer":"Procurement records, including requisitions, quotes, justifications, cybersecurity reviews, purchase orders, receiving records, and invoices, are kept for 7 years after the final payment.","sources":[{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.39769967284177987},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.438923085572663},{"documentName":"it-equipment-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"5a67bef4-7e42-4660-9250-f1a4405d48d1","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.301159Z","chunkId":"8f06696b-71e4-4400-9114-82046e445069","distance":0.48865907822513044}]}}
{"id":"Q07","question":"What is the domestic meal per diem, and how much is paid on the first day of a trip?","response":{"answer":"The domestic meal per diem is $65 per day. On the first day of a trip, the traveler receives 75 percent of the daily rate, which is $48.75.","sources":[{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.34649837947729045},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.5296402769051457},{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.5546213590638478}]}}
{"id":"Q08","question":"Above what amount is a receipt required for an expense?","response":{"answer":"An itemized receipt is required for every expense over $75, except for per diem meals.","sources":[{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.3885686974609275},{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.41143447340997163},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.425102982094817}]}}
{"id":"Q09","question":"When is business class allowed on a flight?","response":{"answer":"Business class is allowed on flights of 6 hours or more, with Vice President approval.","sources":[{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.4016439398211742},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.48183838482344754},{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.49460568320989295}]}}
{"id":"Q10","question":"What is the deadline for submitting an expense report?","response":{"answer":"The deadline for submitting an expense report is within 30 days after the trip ends. Reports submitted more than 60 days after the trip end are not reimbursed.","sources":[{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.452716059437024},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.47219416619040533},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.49854081822281393}]}}
{"id":"Q11","question":"How often do hazmat shippers need recurrent training?","response":{"answer":"According to the fictional sample document provided, hazmat shippers need recurrent training every 24 months after their initial training.","sources":[{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.36873280049011636},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.5344481878394637},{"documentName":"it-equipment-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"5a67bef4-7e42-4660-9250-f1a4405d48d1","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.301159Z","chunkId":"8f06696b-71e4-4400-9114-82046e445069","distance":0.5468055794571903}]}}
{"id":"Q12","question":"How quickly must a hazmat spill be reported?","response":{"answer":"According to the fictional policy document provided, any spill, leak, fire, or damaged hazmat package must be reported to the Safety Office within 2 hours of discovery.","sources":[{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.3584154529908873},{"documentName":"it-equipment-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"5a67bef4-7e42-4660-9250-f1a4405d48d1","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.301159Z","chunkId":"8f06696b-71e4-4400-9114-82046e445069","distance":0.5093188974454128},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.5204692760871485}]}}
{"id":"Q13","question":"How soon must a lost company laptop be reported?","response":{"answer":"According to the policy, a lost or stolen company laptop must be reported to the IT Service Desk within 1 hour of noticing it is missing.","sources":[{"documentName":"it-equipment-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"5a67bef4-7e42-4660-9250-f1a4405d48d1","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.301159Z","chunkId":"8f06696b-71e4-4400-9114-82046e445069","distance":0.3380180097327834},{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.4752392932995325},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"aa155bb8-9394-4c93-9cd0-2e81c27699ae","distance":0.47855129124088325}]}}
{"id":"Q14","question":"What is the company's parental leave policy?","response":{"answer":"I'm sorry, but the provided context does not include any information about the company's parental leave policy. The document you shared appears to be a collection of travel and expense policies, IT equipment and data handling guidelines, and hazardous materials shipping regulations for Bluefield Transport Services. There is no mention of parental leave in any of these sections.","sources":[{"documentName":"travel-expense-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"78fea394-02cb-4650-ac92-0c801787e216","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.033428Z","chunkId":"e2e63a0e-c309-4fed-9ab0-8bf794ba00a6","distance":0.4379899136041723},{"documentName":"it-equipment-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"5a67bef4-7e42-4660-9250-f1a4405d48d1","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.301159Z","chunkId":"8f06696b-71e4-4400-9114-82046e445069","distance":0.4392812377243803},{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.4685799194224737}]}}
{"id":"Q15","question":"What is the dress code for warehouse staff?","response":{"answer":"I'm sorry, but the context provided does not include any information about the dress code for warehouse staff. The document you've shared appears to be related to hazardous materials shipping policies, IT equipment handling, procurement, and purchase order approval. It does not address workplace attire requirements.","sources":[{"documentName":"hazmat-shipping-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"b0bb1e05-285b-4c9c-b9a4-0ba4e46c5f98","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.151322Z","chunkId":"d2d4c69b-52b9-4f7c-8b04-4e9c2525d1d1","distance":0.4717119234596382},{"documentName":"it-equipment-policy","documentVersion":1,"documentId":"5a67bef4-7e42-4660-9250-f1a4405d48d1","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.301159Z","chunkId":"8f06696b-71e4-4400-9114-82046e445069","distance":0.5137046506635521},{"documentName":"procurement-policy","documentVersion":2,"documentId":"3c58c0d7-48d3-4452-aecf-a7b2f2541230","effectiveFrom":"2026-11-03T23:05:54.612208Z","chunkId":"8974ceeb-ae0a-4400-8f58-e4dcb9c35fa1","distance":0.5215695325838094}]}}
